## Feature File Tags Example

Add tags to your feature files:

```gherkin
@smoke @critical
Scenario: User can login
  Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
  And User Login as "Admin"
  Then Dashboard loads

@regression @wip
Scenario: Password reset
  Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
  And User clicks forgot password
  Then Reset email sent

@performance
Scenario: Login completes in 5 seconds
  Given User navigate to Salesforce Application
  And User Login as "Admin"
  Then Page loads within 5 seconds
```

Then run:
```bash
# Only @smoke
npm run test:tags

# Only @regression
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="@regression" npm test

# @smoke and @critical
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke and @critical" npm test

# Everything except @wip
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="not @wip" npm test
```

