## Common Issues & Solutions

### "cross-env command not found"
**Solution:** Use npm scripts instead:
```bash
npm run test:headed  # Instead of: cross-env HEADED=true npm test
```

### Tags not filtering
**Solution:** Ensure tags start with `@` in feature files:
```gherkin
@smoke        ✓ Correct
smoke         ✗ Wrong - missing @
@SMOKE-123    ✓ Correct
```

### Parallel execution seems slow
**Solution:** Reduce workers count:
```bash
npm run test:parallel  # Uses 4 workers
# Change to 2 workers instead
cross-env CUCUMBER_WORKERS=2 npm test
```

